{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "03aa7dd2024bdb67c0189fd3339e74ce6c65c8aaa3b49a60b09d79c7b0c094c0", "ja": "たまには、そんなときもあるの！", "zh": "偶尔也会有这种时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dd4d9fb663022680aa75ef2c552e9d277dcc12836661df058ecd38c28dfcdc52", "ja": "後輩達に渡した手紙の反応を気にする伊織。\n実は、先輩としての自分に不安を覚えている\nと打ち明けるが、プロデューサーのアド\nバイスによって、いつもの笑顔を\n取り戻すのだった。", "zh": "伊织相当在意后辈们\n收到信后会有什么反应，\n并坦言对自己的前辈身分感到不安，\n但在制作人的建议下，\n她找回了平时的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d221cde3c29768867d8a9afa002d00879a26c363e13c27a483b134d6822b921", "ja": "（レジェンドデイズの公演に向けて、スタッフ間の打ち\n合わせも大詰め……さあ、もうひと踏ん張りだ！）", "zh": "（工作团队针对『Legend Days』公演的讨论\n也到了最后阶段……好，再努力一下就好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1001_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "be121c006a6d6993dea13ab78d76eb6910ae535d531a8bc02b2a706c071cf00d", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっといいかしら。", "zh": "{$P$}，你有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d2704be163743d6b70894bd351b1c9722b804acfa9b4e6f6a0f75a83b7705ad1", "ja": "伊織か。ちょうど仕事が一区切りついたところ\nだけど……、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "伊织吗？我的工作正好告一段落……\n有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "2aa80717482c0ed7e7a0dcc89e147417b6474cb3980eafc77005626dcce40526", "ja": "どうかしたのか、じゃないわよ。\nいつまで待てば、教えてくれるの？", "zh": "还敢问我有什么事，\n你要到什么时候才打算告诉我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "be033ebe058510e43c10a7e163fb896ed9331e15c70aeb03544b5d837a0d9c7c", "ja": "ん？　ええと、すまん、何か約束してたっけ……？", "zh": "嗯？那个，抱歉，我有跟你约定好什么吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "e4bcaa8ccb717f823298a39b2356064abedd1e88b6128b08c78660de763ce500", "ja": "してなくたって気を利かせるのが、プロデューサー\nってもんでしょ！？　まったく……ニブいんだから。", "zh": "即使没约定好也要主动关心，这才是制作人吧！？\n你实在是……太迟钝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "218f61b4bc5c3a1f70dec11f861bcb8878b38c4a9305a11ebdcc2cb6209d9d05", "ja": "ほら、この前私たち、39プロジェクトの子たちに\n手紙を渡したでしょ！　……なにか、聞いてない？", "zh": "我们之前不是有写信给39PROJECT的其他人吗！\n……你有没有听她们说过什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e4adc1198d0e139f71c370e6e049e7154529d6777e99f3961c120e564edcda34", "ja": "ああ……、みんなの反応が気になってるんだな。\n自分で直接聞いたらいいのに。", "zh": "哦……你是在好奇大家的反应吧。\n你可以直接去问她们啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "2ffc69c5f18f17e572baa1263c564d140bc1f7254588538dfe4e1a49f16bcf84", "ja": "そんなことしたら、私のイメージがこわれるじゃない。\nそしたらカワイソウでしょ？　あの子たちが！", "zh": "我要是这么做，形象不就毁了吗？\n这么一来那些女孩不是很可怜吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "84058492c36e45378e8842b7c854f86f73f56820e1e0abb3e77fc998838e00b1", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。でも、俺に聞くのはいいのか？\n俺の中の伊織のイメージが……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？不过，问我就没关系吗？\n伊织在我心中的形象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "171ad79a88b8eb62069d1ae68f2050a6bd4330ddcde71100094f7fe4a87c9ea5", "ja": "アンタはいいのよ、アンタなんだし、別にカワイソウ\nじゃないし。……で、なんか聞いてないワケ！？", "zh": "你没差啊，反正是你，也没什么好可怜的。\n……所以你什么都没听说吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b1a81081a272325c1ec71234fdee19be2663f14e4898760c9aa366bcd3217a27", "ja": "でも、特に俺から感想を聞いたりしてないしな……。\n手紙を渡した時の様子は見てたけど。", "zh": "因为我没有特别去问她们的感想……\n但她们收到信的时候，我倒是有看见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "c0b819b75ac83413c6749c276373016139d0c3df9403cd9bd4c9182be00e2cde", "ja": "じゃあ、そっちでいいわ。\n渡した時はどんな様子だったか、きかせてちょうだい。", "zh": "那也可以。\n告诉我，她们收到信的时候是什么样子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "429680a3036a9e5b02d52d6fbca95d73db17970e1813c71ad70385f856997e76", "ja": "そりゃ、みんな喜んでたよ。\nものすごく感動してたかな。", "zh": "大家当然都很高兴啊，\n应该也非常感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a487089fe7c97aa4e685a9bae3750b0950a8762bb4bd51411f497e41fe2ada9a", "ja": "読みながら涙ぐんだり、何度も読み返したり。\nやる気もアップしたみたいで、俺としても助かった。", "zh": "她们边看边哭，反复看了好几遍，\n好像变得更有干劲，让我也很庆幸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "0efa8ad47180eca14b1ce1f7f0b825f8b004491432d460ec34f7e72412a8a2a8", "ja": "そ、そう……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "e63ff549f661eceb5bdfb9450f52071c03c9aca1064ea2cefaef2e601bb81488", "ja": "まあ、当然よね～！　この水瀬伊織ちゃん直筆の\n手紙なんだから、これで……よかったのよ、ね？", "zh": "不过，这也是当然的吧～！毕竟是我，\n水濑伊织亲笔写的信嘛，这样……就好了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6b88409293f083ffc058efa8787b1c79ecacdf91693e25e94da98ee6de6d7d3d", "ja": "……何か、思うところがあるみたいだな。\n何がそんなに気になるんだ？", "zh": "……你好像有什么心事。\n你到底在担心什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "c40a0d76654db28c4d3f70808a52489d8e49c3564249bd6c15bae7f0c0f064c1", "ja": "べ、別に……、そんなに気になるっていうほど、\n大したことじゃないわ。ただ……。", "zh": "没、没有啊……也没有严重到担心的程度，\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "35df7b75874bd51ade260eff5c0fec293fc4635499b0f74dcec010d865e1e704", "ja": "ただ、手紙を渡した後で、不安になっちゃったの。\n私、こんなことできる立場なのかな、って……。", "zh": "只是把信交出去后，我突然觉得很不安。\n我有资格做这种事情吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "129611b148d2af4fd01208b3199b1fbfb27adae923cd42bbd8550c02d4565371", "ja": "伊織……。", "zh": "伊织……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1022_007ior", "source_sha256": "69d42de2a7529ef0e986d877567dcccdf11c943bf0cbf258f4a9e6a5f7b856b2", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっとよ、ちょっと思っただけなんだから！\nだって……。", "zh": "一、一点点，我只有一点点这种想法而已！\n因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "92def106fda1072c4b38671afc86f5e19169b2c415bf3bb608eb85a222b005cd", "ja": "ほんのちょこっとだけだけど、中にはもう\n今の時点で、すごいなって思う子もいるし……。", "zh": "虽然只有少数几位，\n但那些女孩里已经有人让我很佩服了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "c0da88c2c567d6aa51d3f51790d2d336fea27403de6d582c885c2ee0e63b0fb1", "ja": "それにみんな、きっとあっという間に成長するわ。\nその時、私たちはもっと先にいないといけないけど…。", "zh": "而且，大家肯定一下子就会进步。\n到时候我们必须比她们站在更前面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "32d54c789da2ea11a0a596a54ac6d83e9812b83e3a4fc04190a80475c1d98615", "ja": "もちろん、私たちだって前に進んでると思う。\nでも、なんていうか……。", "zh": "我们当然也会向前迈进，\n但是，怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "26feebcf412c8cc40127f8b6a20ff5406754466a6dc99b054b483bc38f39523f", "ja": "今は目の前の仕事に夢中だから、自分たちが\nどれだけ進めてるのか、よくわからなくて……。", "zh": "现在我们只专注在眼前的工作，\n所以我不太确定我们前进多少了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e9aa1a8e2d0c09e1d91eecadcfbff43ce3baea7b3e5e3fc8df83dc7a8c0db643", "ja": "そっか……。すまない、伊織のそういう不安に\n気づいてやれなかったのは、俺のミスだよな……。", "zh": "原来如此……抱歉，我没发现伊织有这种烦恼，\n这是我的失误……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "f33db849c6a1e5692c9d6a88d3229f5d2021833d2e55bd80df7b60248b0284d8", "ja": "そんなの……気にしなくて、いいけど。", "zh": "你……不用在意这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b1c5483ff93da87f0d363209d50b41c9b88200bf1bb05da90183e63a42781293", "ja": "そんな伊織だから、まあ、そのままでいいと思う。\n大丈夫だ！", "zh": "因为伊织你是这样的人，所以我觉得你维持现状就好。\n没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "627f215c2f4208423696a394661fd56ff792098ea09227db4a4ebd3ccb6d132f", "ja": "はあ！？　ちょっと、なによその投げやりな返事は！\nもっと真剣にアドバイスしたらどうなの！？", "zh": "什么！？等等，这种敷衍的回答算什么啊！\n你不能再认真一点给我建议吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "257dc1f26cb02ae68b16ae84c30bcc1af1aa0d8730b95c38102be9391e35d5a3", "ja": "いや、真剣なつもりなんだけどな。だって……。", "zh": "不是，我很认真啊，因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c2be8849eacf5ed9cdf320d14aa62b52f4b8a784deee4c9474da1f56074d623e", "ja": "伊織は今みたいに、\nちゃんと自分のことも、心配できてるじゃないか。", "zh": "你不是像刚才一样，\n能够好好关注自己的状况吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "c17fd58636da082bc31195896ded959d95091c160cdb766adb517c5eb276a00f", "ja": "冷静に後輩の実力を認めて、自分に足りないものを\n見つけて、そして前を向いている……。", "zh": "冷静认同后辈的实力，发现自己不足的地方，\n然后积极面对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6d48fb691bb642970678f1110e1177e31bb048b4e9f18d2e14c3d31afc249909", "ja": "しかも、つい最近、初心を思い出したばかり。\nこれ以上、何をアドバイスしろって言うんだ？", "zh": "而且，你最近才刚回想起初心。\n你说我还能再给你什么建议呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "648a61aa386e7c2f54c10fb4df965fde1e7e90d1cecffc06d9677620116d3acf", "ja": "そ、そうよね、その通りよねっ。\n私にアドバイスなんか、必要ないわよね！", "zh": "说、说得也是，你说的没错，\n我根本不需要建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1038_007ior", "source_sha256": "4e9845524bc6a96e73afa409ccc16fe4a5c97d418ff783788b2e6d1425b7fa67", "ja": "今はただ、その……。\n念のため、確認したかっただけ！", "zh": "刚才我只是那个……\n只是以防万一，想确认一下而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3dfffced8a74d07997a11d2f8bc22e7c7340a3982252659052ca4f3a3786ccdc", "ja": "ああ、その通りだと思う。\nというわけで、確認も完了だ。大丈夫！", "zh": "嗯，你说的没错。\n所以，你也已经确认完了，放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "6cf0b2d6aefd3934d9d899d7ab656ca6cfb4f62f5a11fc49a95d0ba48738ccce", "ja": "これからも、劇場のみんなの永遠の目標になる\nくらいの、最高のトップアイドルを目指していこう！", "zh": "接下来也继续加油，迈向顶尖偶像的巅峰，\n成为剧场偶像永远的目标吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1041_007ior", "source_sha256": "1852ad52a6db51b04210e15128fecd83c996d6756434cac94abc9d05a3704a61", "ja": "決まってるじゃない！　私は絶対に、トップアイドル\nになるの。誰にも負けないわ。あの子たちにもね。", "zh": "这还用说吗！我绝对会成为顶尖偶像。\n我不会输给任何人，包括那些女孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1042_007ior", "source_sha256": "589a1074973d50df0a076ebc6f1a15c7d44260359d6ae1adb874803f0a70e346", "ja": "そういうわけだから、とりあえずオレンジジュース、\n買ってきてくれる？", "zh": "事情就是这样，\n所以你可以先去买杯柳橙汁来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "a316ef3b32b859cbc175fce189d4972617deada2215d62ca9d58a21181c10c0a", "ja": "えっ。なぜ……？", "zh": "咦？为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1044_007ior", "source_sha256": "94666e7df01118740cc8bcd61da3c06488ae6747dbe45fce1cf544dd32e1d688", "ja": "喋りすぎて、すっかりノドが渇いちゃったわ。\nそれともアンタ、弱ったアイドルを見捨てる気？", "zh": "我说了太多话，口非常渴。\n还是说，你打算对虚弱的偶像见死不救？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "2d9d126ed414c3b68a7bd5419bdb50ff9d686f3a99b7036d26ed51877311b77a", "ja": "やれやれ、わかったよ。\nえ～っと、いつものヤツだよな？", "zh": "唉，我知道了。\n呃～老样子对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1046_007ior", "source_sha256": "29179aebca147038ef1c18746afada58d63838103310debc08fd004af000434a", "ja": "そう、100％のフレッシュオレンジジュース！\nいつもの絞りたてのをお願いね。にひひっ♪", "zh": "对，100%的新鲜柳橙汁！\n麻烦照惯例买现榨的喔，咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "78589b69968ee1123f7f1dcee956586a40ed562f539f840a08d7546ee7fc0504", "ja": "（廊下に出た俺を見送る伊織の顔には、すっかり\nいつも通りの、いたずらな微笑みが浮かんでいた）", "zh": "（伊织看着我离开房间，\n脸上浮现出一如以往的淘气微笑。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0021_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0021_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "0fb5c19ed851b675ed60b3aca9ca8676c1af9fb333b1d302fe2c0aab9981c11d", "ja": "（それはそうと、劇場の自販機にフレッシュオレンジ\nジュースの導入を検討するべきだな……）", "zh": "（话说，应该考虑在剧场的自动贩卖机\n引进新鲜柳橙汁了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
